ed_at":"2020-05-21T17:12:58Z","updated_at":"2020-05-25T19:14:41Z","closed_at":"2020-05-25T19:14:41Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"```\r\nvoid BoundedRocksDbIterator::SeekToLast() {\r\n  if (!key_bounds_->upper.empty()) {\r\n    iterator_->Seek(key_bounds_->upper);\r\n^^^\r\n  } else {\r\n    iterator_->SeekToLast();\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n`key_bounds_->upper` is exclusive, so we need to move to prev key in case if seek was successful and seek to last key otherwise.\r\n\r\nCurrently, this code path is only used for 2nd post-split tablet which is bounded by `key_bounds_->upper`, for example during the reverse scan.","closed_by":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/4542/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url